# Agent skills copied out of the ueca-react package by "ueca-react-skills" (our postinstall).
# Generated - do not edit in place; re-run "npm install" after upgrading ueca-react.
# The whole folder, so a skill directory added by a future release cannot slip in untracked.
# Our own project skill is the one exception - it is not generated and belongs in the repo.
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/ueca-doc-maintenance/
